cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use oh-my-agent in your research or work, please cite it as below."
title: "oh-my-agent: Mechanical Verification for AI Coding Agents"
abstract: >-
  oh-my-agent provides mechanical verification for AI coding agents. It can
  be installed as a portable .agents-based skills pack or as a full harness
  with stop-hook gates, artifact checks, independent judges, and an
  append-only event log. It supports shared skills, workflows, and
  orchestration across multiple AI coding runtimes.
